!docs/disclaimer.svg

# ================================================================
# 远界 私有化定制补充
# ================================================================

# --- 把上游一刀切挡掉的源码资源放回来 ---
# 上游用 `*png` `*svg` `*jpg` 把所有图片都挡了, 结果源码里的图标资源
# (flutter/assets 的 SVG、平台启动图标、文档配图) 也跟着没了,
# 克隆下来编不出来。这里逐个放回来。
!flutter/assets/**
!flutter/android/**
!flutter/ios/**
!flutter/linux/**
!flutter/macos/**
!flutter/windows/**
!res/**
!fastlane/metadata/**
!libs/**
!.deploy/**
# libs 下的编译产物还是要挡
libs/**/target/

# --- bridge 生成代码: 提交进来, 保证 clone 下来就能编 ---
# 上游靠 CI 重新生成, 本仓库不跑 CI, 所以直接提交。
# 重新生成的话用 flutter_rust_bridge_codegen 1.80.1 (--llvm-path 指向 libclang)。
!src/bridge_generated.rs
!src/bridge_generated.io.rs
!flutter/lib/generated_bridge.dart
!flutter/lib/generated_bridge.freezed.dart
!flutter/ios/Runner/bridge_generated.h
!flutter/macos/Runner/bridge_generated.h

# --- 本地构建产物 / 依赖缓存 / 下载包 (不提交) ---
.vendor/
/installed/
/vcpkg_installed/
/.dl/
/.trash/
/logs/
flutter/.dart_tool/
flutter/build/
**/ephemeral/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc

# --- 服务端官方二进制和打好的套件: 不是源码 ---
# 需要的时候去 D:\Software\rustdesk-deployment 取现成的部署包。
.deploy/package/server/amd64/
.deploy/package/server/arm64/
.deploy/*.zip
.vcpkg-assets/

# --- 敏感信息: 绝对不能进版本库 ---
# 面板账号密码 / agent token 只放在服务器的 /etc/rustdesk-panel/panel.conf
.deploy/panel-credentials.txt
*.pem.key
.env.local

# 注释批量翻译的中间产物
.deploy/tools/batches/
.deploy/tools/commit-msg.txt
.deploy/deploy-panel.resolved.sh
.deploy/tools/remote-url.txt
